  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal models (config_016) outperform RNA-only (config_001), but the impact of RNA encoder choice (pca_n2000 vs scvi_n200) remains unclear. This experiment tests a multimodal setup with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder, using the same concatenation fusion and no aggregation as config_016. It isolates the RNA encoder's effect, helping determine if encoder choice is critical. This addresses key uncertainty while building on the promising multimodal baseline."
